title: "Operating-Point Retention in Continual Industrial Anomaly Detection"
abstract: >-
  Code repository containing an INP-Former continual-training implementation (shared-FT,
  EWC, shared-LoRA, subspace-LoRA, and experience replay), stored-threshold FPR/FNR plus
  image-AUROC operating-point evaluation, and offline delta-sensitivity analysis tools.
